2026-07-07 12:22:00,218 | AGENT | TechnicalArchitect Agent answered: To meet the client's requirements, we can propose a technical architecture that leverages our expertise in cloud architecture, API integration, and cybersecurity. We will deploy the solution on SecNumCloud, ensuring data protection and sovereignty. 

We will design a hybrid cloud architecture using OVHcloud or Outscale, which are equivalent to SecNumCloud, to ensure high availability of 99.9% and response time under 2 seconds. Our containerisation expertise with Docker and Kubernetes will enable us to orchestrate the deployment efficiently.

