To monitor the system's performance and ensure high availability, we will use monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack. Our experience with IaC tools like Terraform and Ansible can help us automate the deployment and management of the infrastructure.

Overall, our proposed technical architecture will meet the client's requirements for data protection, sovereignty, high availability, response time, and integration with existing information systems.
